{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Barkeeping 是一款為養狗家庭而設的照顧記錄工具，把餵食、如廁與意外情況集中在一處，讓同住家人看到同一份最新資訊。無論是分工照顧幼犬，還是追蹤家居訓練進度，都能減少口頭交接的混亂。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>全家共享狗狗照顧記錄</h2>\n<p>Barkeeping 讓全家同步記錄狗狗的餵食、如廁與意外情況，各成員以 iPhone、iPad 或 Apple Watch 登記後，都看到誰在何時做了甚麼。App 會從記錄學習每隻狗的作息，並在該外出時以通知、主畫面小工具與即時動態倒數提醒。歷史圖表比較外出與意外次數，方便追蹤訓練進度，亦可透過 Siri 快速記錄或查詢。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-399-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-400-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-401-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-402-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-403-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Barkeeping</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-25T22:18:21.458676+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":334,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}